e_name": "DynamicGoniometerXR_Screenshot_02_2560x1440.png", "id": "4535825333356689", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908771252_4535825336690022_7732940499809174104_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7WdnmLMUJ_cQ7kNvwFnLxYX&_nc_oc=Adrahm3AUbA_e0H6_dnthuRzTUE4W7JtVZuXGKzV0lmi3mYpRWc5bYyqGGFlqi6CgJg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXJjfqHqJCVtm3FJdfREWWzm2v0hPpQyMkadhteKqe_wg&oe=6B105826"}, {"file_name": "DynamicGoniometerXR_Screenshot_05_2560x1440.png", "id": "2167330150526976", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908771243_2167330153860309_7594932916521772549_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BdlkSkr20YEQ7kNvwFW_8wK&_nc_oc=AdqYq-0m5HqzoIOLp4uvqb28L4gqnkFjSe1zUpYINpDY2TVTlK2sXU0dLbo-QKjpU-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVCHO2_EIC66Ooh52saQ_v2NXaqV4Fp6DCzNsJixzBbQQ&oe=6B103C2D"}, {"file_name": "DynamicGoniometerXR_Screenshot_04_2560x1440.png", "id": "1798253211480453", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908771262_1798253214813786_1185953605652853415_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8JbdzDiYJtUQ7kNvwHFMs__&_nc_oc=AdoZEPyd9nH1yWhyLXBBehIh4xkZJRpEt4RS0CXumGsjJ4RcqzNLhNhM3gsXr7AMx2w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWd7xrVLuptUPL6Q0IPLoXSux2LWObgoWWhz4oCrsTAJw&oe=6B103552"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "DynamicGoniometerXR_Trailer_Cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "29734558522843045", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908771268_29734558542843043_8494115743450420009_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cW3l7Nw3dcYQ7kNvwGo6MCv&_nc_oc=AdosD2y-qmF_Harri9HgznMtOmi4s0VNzvlf0MS3Hi9Q9fY6PmtwPTTcnjtppbm1IEo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWakDdJ8tvm3iApEb82SBFCmj6K_GANqBfIxpbsQzGlfg&oe=6B106973"}, "display_name": "Dynamic Goniometer XR", "keywords": ["goniometer", "measurement", "angles", "motion", "education"], "long_description": "Observe three-point angles and motion in mixed reality on Meta Quest 3 and 3S.\n\nDynamic Goniometer XR recognizes the supplied Original image, QR or ArUco targets. Auto selects one complete target family; explicit choices are also available. Place red M at the angle vertex, with green P and blue D forming the two arms. Keep all three visible.\n\nRead the included angle, supplement, minimum, maximum and observed range. Tracking labels distinguish live, held and missing data. Move and resize the main panel while keeping the separate measurement HUD visible.\n\nUse controllers or hand tracking. Manual points records held spatial points. Align 3D markers through the guided three-point registration workflow.\n\nSave result PNGs, including the camera view when available, and export session CSV files locally. Camera and measurement processing stays on the headset. There is no app account, advertising, analytics or app-operated cloud service.\n\nRecognition requires supplied markers printed at the measured size, compatible Horizon OS, passthrough and camera permission. Export printable targets from Settings.\n\nFor trained adult users, teaching and research. Results depend on setup and tracking and must be independently checked. No diagnosis, treatment recommendation, clinical validation or certified surgical navigation is claimed.", "short_description": "Observe three-point angles and range of motion in mixed reality on Meta Quest 3 and 3S. Use supplied printed targets or held manual points, view angle statistics, and save local PNG and CSV results."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.orthopractis.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.orthopractis.com/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "ORTHOPRACTIS COM SINGLE MEMBER P C", "support_web